---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { LOGO_VIEWBOX, LOGO_INNER_TRANSFORM, CHAIR_PATH, ORB_PATH } from "../lib/logoPaths.js";
---
<Base
  title="Outside the Chair | No Empty Chair"
  description="Work outside the beauty and wellness space."
  canonical="https://noemptychair.co/outside-the-chair"
  noindex={true}>
  <main id="main" class="disc-page">
    <header class="tp-head">
      <a href="/" class="tp-logo">No Empty <span>Chair</span></a>
    </header>
    <div class="tp-wrap">
      <div class="tp-done otc-wrap">
        <div class="tp-mark">
          <svg width="44" height="55.6" viewBox={LOGO_VIEWBOX} preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" role="img" aria-label="No Empty Chair mark">
            <g fill="#413645" stroke="none"><g transform={LOGO_INNER_TRANSFORM}><path d={CHAIR_PATH} /></g></g>
            <g transform={LOGO_INNER_TRANSFORM}><path d={ORB_PATH} fill="#a85a76" /></g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Outside the chair</h1>
        <p>Most of what I build lives in the beauty and wellness world. Every so often something outside that world needs the same care. Here's one of those.</p>

        <div class="otc-card">
          <div class="otc-preview">
            <svg class="otc-preview-icon" viewBox="0 0 120 120" width="56" height="56" role="img" aria-label="Voice Unlocked mark">
              <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="58" fill="#f4eedd" stroke="#4b2e63" stroke-width="2" />
              <rect x="42" y="58" width="36" height="30" rx="6" fill="#4b2e63" />
              <path d="M48 58 V46 a12 12 0 0 1 24 0 V58" fill="none" stroke="#4b2e63" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <circle cx="60" cy="70" r="4" fill="#f4eedd" />
              <rect x="58" y="72" width="4" height="8" fill="#f4eedd" />
              <g transform="translate(60 40)">
                <ellipse cx="-8" cy="-4" rx="9" ry="12" fill="#8b5fa8" transform="rotate(-20 -8 -4)" />
                <ellipse cx="8" cy="-4" rx="9" ry="12" fill="#8b5fa8" transform="rotate(20 8 -4)" />
                <ellipse cx="-6" cy="8" rx="5" ry="7" fill="#a97fc4" transform="rotate(-15 -6 8)" />
                <ellipse cx="6" cy="8" rx="5" ry="7" fill="#a97fc4" transform="rotate(15 6 8)" />
                <line x1="0" y1="-10" x2="0" y2="10" stroke="#4b2e63" stroke-width="2" />
              </g>
            </svg>
            <div class="otc-preview-word">VOICE UNLOCKED</div>
            <div class="otc-preview-tag">Your Voice Is Your Power</div>
          </div>
          <div class="otc-body">
            <div class="otc-k">Brand &amp; Launch Strategy</div>
            <h2>Voice Unlocked</h2>
            <p>A domestic violence awareness podcast and advocacy brand. Worked through logo direction, brand voice, audience, and a launch plan for the show's first season.</p>
            <a href="https://instagram.com/__voiceunlocked" class="otc-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the account on Instagram →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="otc-note">Preview mark above is an original stylized interpretation for this page, not Voice Unlocked's actual artwork.</p>

        <a href="/" class="tp-back-link">← Back to the site</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <style>
    .otc-wrap{max-width:560px;}
    .otc-card{margin:30px auto 0;max-width:480px;display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;background:var(--white,#fff);border:1px solid var(--line,#e7ddd0);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 26px;box-shadow:0 18px 40px -28px rgba(65,54,69,.4);}
    .otc-preview{flex:0 0 112px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;background:#f4eedd;border:1px solid rgba(75,46,99,.18);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 10px;}
    .otc-preview-word{margin-top:8px;font-family:"Marcellus",serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#4b2e63;line-height:1.3;}
    .otc-preview-tag{margin-top:3px;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#8b5fa8;font-style:italic;}
    .otc-body{flex:1;min-width:0;}
    .otc-k{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--rose,#a85a76);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;}
    .otc-card h2{font-family:"Marcellus",serif;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--ink,#2a232e);}
    .otc-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted,#6b5f57);margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.55;}
    .otc-link{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--rose,#a85a76);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(168,90,118,.4);}
    .otc-link:hover{color:var(--ink,#2a232e);}
    .otc-note{max-width:480px;margin:10px auto 0;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted,#6b5f57);opacity:.8;}
    @media (max-width:560px){
      .otc-card{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;}
      .otc-preview{flex:0 0 auto;}
      .otc-body{text-align:left;width:100%;}
    }
    .tp-back-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#6b5f57);letter-spacing:.03em;}
    .tp-back-link:hover{color:var(--ink,#2a232e);}
  </style>
</Base>
